{"publicId":"92bafc2e-ef82-4865-be08-01c4e54f3c00","title":"IMDEA Networks等团队研究：数字消费数据提升选举预测相关性","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T15:30:09.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T15:30:09.000Z","digest":"IMDEA Networks与卡洛斯三世大学、东北大学及Orange Research合作，通过分析法国2019年和2024年选举期间用户的移动数据（包括Facebook、X等应用使用时长及内容偏好），发现添加数字消费数据后，选举结果预测模型与实际得票率的相关性提升10%-28%（2019年平均10%，2024年平均28%）。研究指出不同应用对政治倾向的关联性存在差异，例如社交媒体使用与内容消费的关联强度不同。该成果于2026年10月12-16日德国卡尔斯鲁厄举办的ACM互联网测量会议（IMC '26）发布，论文标题为《Digital Consumption and Political Alignment: Evidence from Mobile Data Across Two European Elections in France》。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T15:39:53.130Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"IMDEA Networks等团队在ACM IMC 2026发表研究：数字消费与政治倾向的关联性增强","latestReport":{"id":"nzvif84uye4n0gkixmil721pb"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fKaX5d1BJrYY","title":"研究揭示数字消费与政治倾向之间日益增长的联系","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T15:30:09.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"nzvif84uye4n0gkixmil721pb","title":"IMDEA Networks等团队在ACM IMC 2026发表研究：数字消费与政治倾向的关联性增强","summary":"IMDEA Networks等团队在2026 ACM互联网测量会议发表研究，显示添加Facebook、X（原Twitter）等应用使用数据可使选举结果预测相关性提升10%-28%。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T15:30:09.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"nzvif84uye4n0gkixmil721pb","title":"IMDEA Networks等团队在ACM IMC 2026发表研究：数字消费与政治倾向的关联性增强","summary":"IMDEA Networks等团队在2026 ACM互联网测量会议发表研究，显示添加Facebook、X（原Twitter）等应用使用数据可使选举结果预测相关性提升10%-28%。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T15:30:09.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T17:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T20:0